id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m047-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"漢使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p048","text":"楊信既歸，漢使王烏，而單于復肴甘言，欲多得漢財物，紿謂王烏曰：「吾欲入漢見天子，面相約爲兄弟。」王烏歸報漢，漢爲單于築邸于長安。匈奴曰：「非得漢貴人使，吾不與誠語。」匈奴使其貴人至漢，病，漢予藥，欲愈之，不幸而死。而漢使路充國佩二千石印綬往使，因送其喪，厚葬直數千金，曰「此漢貴人也」。單于以爲漢殺吾貴使者，乃留路充國不歸。諸所言者，單于特空紿王烏，殊無意入漢及遣太子來質。於是匈奴數使奇兵侵犯邊。漢乃拜郭昌爲拔胡將軍，及浞野侯屯朔方以東，備胡。路充國留匈奴三歳，單于死。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"楊信","kind":"person","person_id":"rk6_uic_hnm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"王烏","kind":"person","person_id":"h4f_jdj_gwf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_aj1_4tp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"王烏","kind":"person","person_id":"h4f_jdj_gwf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_aj1_4tp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mgp_xt9_j5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"王烏","kind":"person","person_id":"h4f_jdj_gwf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_aj1_4tp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0069","start":69,"end":75,"surface":"非得漢貴人使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0076","start":76,"end":81,"surfa