,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_aj1_4tp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p049","text":"烏維單于立十歳而死，子烏師廬立爲單于。年少，號爲兒單于。是歳元封六年也。自此之後，單于益西北，左方兵直雲中，右方直酒泉、燉煌郡。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"烏維單于","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_aj1_4tp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"烏師廬","kind":"person","person_id":"du1_540_vpf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"立爲單于","kind":"person","person_id":"du1_540_vpf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"兒單于","kind":"person","person_id":"du1_540_vpf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"du1_540_vpf","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-110","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","source":{"title":"史記／卷110","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷110","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","revision_id":8735645,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證去介面及現代節標題後61段，末段為太史公論。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去 header2 介面及現代單于節標題、太史公曰節標題；移除單字語言轉